Each skill's "## Provenance" section lists the exact source files.

1. mattpocock/skills
   https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
   MIT License. Copyright (c) 2026 Matt Pocock
   Used in: skills/grill, skills/domain-memory, skills/start, scripts/skill-lint.mjs

2. kentcdodds/kcd-skills
   https://github.com/kentcdodds/kcd-skills
   MIT License. Copyright (c) 2026 Kent C. Dodds
   Used in: skills/decide, skills/domain-memory (decision record template),
   scripts/skill-lint.mjs

3. joelhooks/rat-stack
   https://github.com/joelhooks/rat-stack
   MIT License. Copyright (c) 2026 Joel Hooks
   Used in: hooks/git-policy.mjs, hooks/guard-git.mjs,
   tests/hooks/git-policy.test.mjs, templates/githooks/prepare-commit-msg,
   templates/AGENTS.md (error message format, "Held by" labels),
   scripts/skill-lint.mjs (name must match folder)

4. michaelshimeles/rstack
   https://github.com/michaelshimeles/rstack
   No licence file covers the files used. Author: Michael Shimeles.
   Used in: skills/start and templates/AGENTS.md (task triage, worktree rules)

